</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">22.1&#x000b1;9.0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<bold>Extrapulmonary involvement</bold>
</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">20 (54.1)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
